            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Facial manifestations due to giant cell arteritis are analysed about 102 cases. The whole facial vascular territories are involved, so we have many manifestations. Diagnosis depends on artery biopsy with Doppler aid.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
